OK, I got scared about size of tables file for N-PHY ;) It became quite big and
I am going to add rev3+ tables which means about 6K new lines of data.

My idea is to put PHY-specific data in tables_nphy and radio-specific in
radio_X. I prefer having more files instead of single 10K+ monsters.

What do you think about this? If that OK? Maybe I should put radio files in
some subdir? Comments welcome :)
